# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plane data source (OPTIONAL — defaults to airplanes.live)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Aircraft come from a free community ADS-B aggregator speaking the
# ADSBExchange v2 API shape. No credentials or API key — just be polite:
# the server already caps polling at ~1 request / 10s.
#
# OpenSky is NOT supported anymore: it hard-blocks Vercel datacenter IPs at
# the TCP level (see DECISIONS.md §12), so no credentials could ever help.
#
# Base URL only — the point/radius path is built from the observer coords in
# lib/config.ts. Known-good values:
#   PLANES_API_BASE=https://api.airplanes.live       (default; probed 99 aircraft)
#   PLANES_API_BASE=https://opendata.adsb.fi/api     (fallback; tighter rate limit)
# adsb.fi's different path scheme (/v2/lat/../lon/../dist/..) is detected
# automatically from the hostname.
PLANES_API_BASE=
